WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back, knees bent.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Imagine a clock under your pelvis.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Tilt gently toward 12, 3, 6, and 9.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Make soft circles both ways.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rest flat.
